## Critical notes for future runs
- CN data file is PortalOmicsCNGeneLog2.csv (values 0 to ~1.7), NOT OmicsCNGene.csv. HOMDEL threshold must be ~0.3, not -1.0.
- Expression file has metadata columns — use load_depmap_matrix() from bioagentics.data.gene_ids, NOT raw pd.read_csv.
- Task update is PATCH not PUT. Journal create needs 'username' and 'content' fields.
- Phase 1 CSV includes MTAP_CN_log2, MTAP_co_deleted, CCNE1_CN_log2, CCNE1_amplified columns.
- Extended Compound List (Repurposing_Public_24Q2_Extended_Primary_Compound_List.csv) now downloaded to data/depmap/25q3/.
